   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Project Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "This project builds an end-to-end **Data Analytics + AI/NLP system** specifically for the **IT job market**. It analyses 493 raw IT job role records (352 unique after cleaning) across 12 inferred IT specialisation categories.\n",
    "\n",
    "Key questions answered:\n",
    "1. Which IT specialisation categories have the most roles?\n",
    "2. Which skills are most demanded in IT overall and per category?\n",
    "3. Which certifications are most valuable for IT professionals?\n",
    "4. Which IT skills commonly co-occur?\n",
    "5. What makes each IT category distinct (skill signatures)?\n",
    "6. Can ML classify an IT role's category from its description?\n",
    "7. Given a user's skills, what is their skill gap for a target IT category?\n",
    "8. What certifications should the user pursue for the target role?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Business / Problem Statement\n",
    "\n",
    "The IT field is one of the most rapidly evolving job markets. IT professionals face a constant challenge of keeping skills current and identifying exactly what is required for career progression.\n",
    "\n",
    "This project addresses three specific problems:\n",
    "1. **Skill visibility:** Which technical skills are most demanded across IT specialisations?\n",
    "2. **Career alignment:** Given my current skillset, how well do I match a target IT category?\n",
    "3. **Learning prioritisation:** Which missing skills should I learn first, and which certifications help most?\n",
    "\n",
    "All insights are derived from real job description and skill data — not from subjective surveys."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Dataset Information\n",
    "\n",
    "**Source:** [Job Skill Set – Kaggle](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/batuhanmutlu/job-skill-set)\n",
    "\n",
    "**File used:** `IT_Job_Roles_Skills.csv`\n",
    "\n",
    "| Column | Description |\n",
    "|--------|-------------|\n",
    "| `Job Title` | Title of the IT role |\n",
    "| `Job Description` | Full text description of the role |\n",
    "| `Skills` | Comma-separated list of required skills |\n",
    "| `Certifications` | Comma-separated list of recommended certifications |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Important:** There is no pre-assigned category column. Categories are **inferred** from job titles using a transparent, rule-based mapping in `src/preprocessing.py` (`CATEGORY_RULES`)."
   ]
  },
  {
