    "## 10. Machine Learning — IT Role Category Classifier\n",
    "\n",
    "### Methodology\n",
    "\n",
    "**Task:** Multi-class classification — predict the IT category (e.g. DevOps & SRE, Software Development, Data & Analytics) from a job description.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Features:** TF-IDF from job descriptions only. The skills column is excluded to avoid data leakage (skills are directly extracted from descriptions).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note on accuracy:** With 352 samples across 11 categories and very similar descriptions across IT domains, achieving 72.9% is a meaningful result. The classifier correctly distinguishes, e.g., Security from DevOps and Management from Engineering roles."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "X, y, valid_cats = prepare_features(df)\n",
    "X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = split_data(X, y, test_size=0.20)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Training: {len(X_train)} | Test: {len(X_test)}')\n",
    "print(f'\\nClass distribution (train):')\n",
    "print(y_train.value_counts().to_string())"
   ]
