    "## 11. Skill Gap Analyzer\n",
    "\n",
    "### Methodology\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Role Skill Profile:** Skills appearing in ≥ 8% of roles in the target IT category.\n",
    "2. **User Skill Normalisation:** Input is comma-separated; skills are normalised to match profile terms.\n",
    "3. **Gap Calculation:**  \n",
    "   - Matched = User ∩ Required  \n",
    "   - Missing = Required − User (sorted by demand frequency)  \n",
    "   - Coverage % = |Matched| / |Required| × 100\n",
    "4. **Certification Recommendations:** Top certifications used in the target category from actual dataset."
